{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, כְּתַב","hw":"כְּתַב","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">כְּתַב</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. write (</strong>v. BH<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:26\" href=\"/Daniel.6.26\">Dn 6:26</a> ל pers. + orat. rect., <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:1\" href=\"/Daniel.7.1\">7:1</a> acc. rei; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּתַ֫בוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:8\" href=\"/Ezra.4.8\">Ezr 4:8</a> acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">אִגְּרָה</span>; 1 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִכְתּוּב</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:10\" href=\"/Ezra.5.10\">5:10</a>, acc. rei; Pt. act. abs. fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּֽתְבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:5\" href=\"/Daniel.5.5\">Dn 5:5</a>, subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְדָא</span>, fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּֽתְבָן</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:5\" href=\"/Daniel.5.5\">5</a>, subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶצְבְּעָן</span>. <strong>Peʿîl</strong> (W<sup>CG 224</sup>) Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּדְנָה כְּתִיב</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:7\" href=\"/Ezra.5.7\">Ezr 5:7</a> <em>thus (it) was written</em>, so <span dir=\"rtl\">כֵּן כ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:2\" href=\"/Ezra.6.2\">6:2</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, כְּתָב","prev":"BDB Aramaic, כַּשְׂדָּ֑י"}